esistance.", "s": 16.9, "e": 21.232}, {"text": "Instead, they found abandoned trenches and stray dogs.", "s": 21.332, "e": 24.246}, {"text": "Japan had secretly evacuated the entire garrison two weeks earlier.", "s": 24.346, "e": 28.358}, {"text": "Tragically, Allied troops still suffered over three hundred casualties from friendly fire and booby traps, showing how...", "s": 28.458, "e": 35.226}]}